Z||000001||Gokart||01-02-2000||08:46 AM||||If you just bought it four days ago I'd bring it back and tell them to fix it or you want your money back! This might jar them enough to make things right or get the truth about what possibly could be wrong. Knowing one prob is the water pump helps, but did you tune it up yet or checked timing? The door comes apart easy enough to find whatevers moving around in there. ||||reg||5
